{"id":"auseinander","lemma":"auseinander","pos":"adv","rank":1740,"glosses":["apart"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/64/De-auseinander.ogg/De-auseinander.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Unsere Familie fällt auseinander.","en":"Our family is falling apart.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"},null]},{"text":"Es fiel auseinander.","en":"It came apart.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/104068","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"},null]},{"text":"Nimm es, wenn nötig, auseinander!","en":"Take it apart if necessary.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"urgently"},null]},{"text":"Der Junge nahm das Radio auseinander.","en":"The boy took the radio apart.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"boy"},{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"radio (technology that…"},null]},{"text":"Sie sind sechs Jahre auseinander.","en":"The difference in their ages is six years.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"six (numerical value…"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},null]}]}